vielotus (2.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.2:
    - Post-coda circumflex bilingual preservation (theme -> theme vs theem -> thêm).
    - Cross-platform code-switching alignment for ee/oo Vietnamese syllables
      in English context (check status treen website -> check status trên website).
    - Full 9,091-case + 44 bilingual phrase regression verification (100.00%).

